(7196258, 1106588, 163430, '<td valign="top">The last sunset of winter went out in flames :-)<br/>Nice. I would prefer a bit more exposure on the foreground (the shore and the water). The sky and the clouds are good the way they are.</td>', 'The last sunset of winter went out in flames :-)Nice. I would prefer a bit more exposure on the foreground (the shore and the water). The sky and the clouds are good the way they are.', '2014-03-31 06:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196260, 1106719, 163430, '<td valign="top">The shape clouds works very well with the terrain on the horizon. Like they are bouncing off the hill. I wonder what would it look like with the sky (and clouds) a bit darker and the groung a bit lighter.</td>', 'The shape clouds works very well with the terrain on the horizon. Like they are bouncing off the hill. I wonder what would it look like with the sky (and clouds) a bit darker and the groung a bit lighter.', '2014-03-31 06:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196262, 1106671, 163430, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition. Sharpness is a bit on the shy side, though.</td>', 'Nice colors and composition. Sharpness is a bit on the shy side, though.', '2014-03-31 06:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
