(7196302, 1106983, 163430, '<td valign="top">Is this a powerplant or an oil reffinery? Or both?<br/> <br/>I like the idea, but the execution is not up to par, at least to me:<br/>- The horizon is dead center<br/>- The image is full of distracting grain and, what looks to me, dust specks.<br/>- The image lack overall sharpness.</td>', 'Is this a powerplant or an oil reffinery? Or both? I like the idea, but the execution is not up to par, at least to me:- The horizon is dead center- The image is full of distracting grain and, what looks to me, dust specks.- The image lack overall sharpness.', '2014-03-31 09:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196305, 1107022, 163430, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image with dramatic clouds. looks like thay are going away from the viewer and trying to suck the tree out of its roots in the process.</td>', 'Nice sharp image with dramatic clouds. looks like thay are going away from the viewer and trying to suck the tree out of its roots in the process.', '2014-03-31 09:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
