(7196352, 1106916, 163430, '<td valign="top">Some people just want to sit and watch the world burn :-)<br/>It would have been a damn fine photo if it weren''t for those specks.</td>', 'Some people just want to sit and watch the world burn :-)It would have been a damn fine photo if it weren''t for those specks.', '2014-03-31 12:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196355, 1107022, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white. Interesting clouds and nice composition.</td>', 'Nice black and white. Interesting clouds and nice composition.', '2014-03-31 12:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196357, 1107032, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice capture with dramatic clouds.</td>', 'Nice capture with dramatic clouds.', '2014-03-31 12:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196358, 1106945, 22970, '<td valign="top">Beautiful valley and nice clouds.</td>', 'Beautiful valley and nice clouds.', '2014-03-31 12:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196361, 1106916, 22970, '<td valign="top">The wide angle works well with your photo. Nice sunrise/sunset. The color of the sky in contrast with the chair is great. Nice cloud formation. Great capture.</td>', 'The wide angle works well with your photo. Nice sunrise/sunset. The color of the sky in contrast with the chair is great. Nice cloud formation. Great capture.', '2014-03-31 12:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196362, 1106626, 22970, '<td valign="top">I love the tonal range in your photo. Great clouds and landscape. Bump while commenting.</td>', 'I love the tonal range in your photo. Great clouds and landscape. Bump while commenting.', '2014-03-31 12:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196363, 1106992, 22970, '<td valign="top">Has the appearance of being remote and the clouds adds drama. Nice.</td>', 'Has the appearance of being remote and the clouds adds drama. Nice.', '2014-03-31 12:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196371, 1106962, 22970, '<td valign="top">My eye are summonsed to the high horizon were there is little detail and darkness. I know you must of had a quandary on your hands and had to choose between leveling the building in the middle or the horizon. The lens used in this case became a double edge sword but I think you made the right choice even with the slight conflict with the left and right side of your photograph. Nice capture and an above average photo. I really like the the color, lines and clouds. Great job.</td>', 'My eye are summonsed to the high horizon were there is little detail and darkness. I know you must of had a quandary on your hands and had to choose between leveling the building in the middle or the horizon. The lens used in this case became a double edge sword but I think you made the right choice even with the slight conflict with the left and right side of your photograph. Nice capture and an above average photo. I really like the the color, lines and clouds. Great job.', '2014-03-31 12:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196372, 1106604, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice tone and wonderful cloud formation. Nice capture.</td>', 'Nice tone and wonderful cloud formation. Nice capture.', '2014-03-31 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196375, 1106932, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very well presented. Love the lines, tone, and clouds. I think B&amp;W was the correct way to go. Great Job. (Bump while commenting)</td>', 'Very well presented. Love the lines, tone, and clouds. I think B&W was the correct way to go. Great Job. (Bump while commenting)', '2014-03-31 12:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196380, 1106901, 22970, '<td valign="top">I know how hard it is to get the correct lighting when shooting fast jets during an airshow, keeping the sky and underneath the jets lite. You did a great job. Nicely presented and a great photo.</td>', 'I know how hard it is to get the correct lighting when shooting fast jets during an airshow, keeping the sky and underneath the jets lite. You did a great job. Nicely presented and a great photo.', '2014-03-31 12:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196384, 1107025, 22970, '<td valign="top">You picture is an example why commenting is good for the photographer and the voter. I had already given you a good score but upon commenting I was able to take more time to view the details within the photograph. Wonderful focal length from the hillside through the valley to the mountain peaks. And the clouds make the photo pop. Top 3 I hope. (Bump at time of comment).</td>', 'You picture is an example why commenting is good for the photographer and the voter. I had already given you a good score but upon commenting I was able to take more time to view the details within the photograph. Wonderful focal length from the hillside through the valley to the mountain peaks. And the clouds make the photo pop. Top 3 I hope. (Bump at time of comment).', '2014-03-31 12:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196488, 1106985, 58634, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the darkness on the left,  with the warm brighnes on the right. 8</td>', 'I enjoy the darkness on the left,  with the warm brighnes on the right. 8', '2014-03-31 16:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196489, 1106604, 58634, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!!</td>', 'Beautiful colors!!', '2014-03-31 16:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196490, 1107020, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the empty and minimalistic feel of this.</td>', 'I like the empty and minimalistic feel of this.', '2014-03-31 16:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196491, 1106945, 58634, '<td valign="top">Great title! It fits the image perfectly.</td>', 'Great title! It fits the image perfectly.', '2014-03-31 16:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196492, 1106636, 58634, '<td valign="top">The soft focus works really great here.</td>', 'The soft focus works really great here.', '2014-03-31 16:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196493, 1106908, 58634, '<td valign="top">I wish this was a bit sharper but this was a great capture.</td>', 'I wish this was a bit sharper but this was a great capture.', '2014-03-31 16:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196494, 1106764, 58634, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the bright and bold blue sky and the geometry that comes along with the building.</td>', 'I appreciate the bright and bold blue sky and the geometry that comes along with the building.', '2014-03-31 16:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196498, 1107029, 58634, '<td valign="top">So simple.. and the dark sky does wonders for the impact this photograph has.</td>', 'So simple.. and the dark sky does wonders for the impact this photograph has.', '2014-03-31 16:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196499, 1106962, 58634, '<td valign="top">Wow is all I can say.</td>', 'Wow is all I can say.', '2014-03-31 16:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7196500, 1106535, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautifully colored, dramatic and spread over the full extent of the sky, the clouds alone are exemplary.  Add them to a wonderful landscape and the visual lead-in of the downed fence --  this would also astound in the fences challenge  -- and you have a glorious image.  The foreground is intimate, the rest of the landscape is breathtaking in scope and the clouds are majestic.  Right into my favorites.</td>', 'Beautifully colored, dramatic and spread over the full extent of the sky, the clouds alone are exemplary.  Add them to a wonderful landscape and the visual lead-in of the downed fence --  this would also astound in the fences challenge  -- and you have a glorious image.  The foreground is intimate, the rest of the landscape is breathtaking in scope and the clouds are majestic.  Right into my favorites.', '2014-03-31 16:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
