(7197310, 1107020, 173844, '<td valign="top">The style of a thin strip of land and an enormous sky is put to effective use here with a smattering of clouds overtopped with a dark empyrean vault.  So here clouds are merely a way station on the ascension to heaven.  The hints of a fence express the sense that the wide world cannot be contained.</td>', 'The style of a thin strip of land and an enormous sky is put to effective use here with a smattering of clouds overtopped with a dark empyrean vault.  So here clouds are merely a way station on the ascension to heaven.  The hints of a fence express the sense that the wide world cannot be contained.', '2014-04-02 00:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7197313, 1106493, 124815, '<td valign="top">Pretty daring. Glad that I''m not in the plane</td>', 'Pretty daring. Glad that I''m not in the plane', '2014-04-02 00:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7197314, 1106877, 173844, '<td valign="top">This modest landscape bursts with a triumphant explosion of sunlit clouds that are beautifully stretched across the sky, bringing life to this brown field.  I like this use of the clouds as metaphor for revelation.  The yellow is very powerful here.</td>', 'This modest landscape bursts with a triumphant explosion of sunlit clouds that are beautifully stretched across the sky, bringing life to this brown field.  I like this use of the clouds as metaphor for revelation.  The yellow is very powerful here.', '2014-04-02 00:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7197315, 1107025, 173844, '<td valign="top">Despite the beauty of the landscape, which lends terrific support, this image is truly about the wonderfully captured radiant clouds that drift across our field of vision.  The level of detail is stellar and the entire photograph is enchanting.</td>', 'Despite the beauty of the landscape, which lends terrific support, this image is truly about the wonderfully captured radiant clouds that drift across our field of vision.  The level of detail is stellar and the entire photograph is enchanting.', '2014-04-02 00:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7197317, 1106991, 173844, '<td valign="top">Funny, I find this pastel image more peaceful than eerie.  The mountains and the clouds fade nicely into the larger scene, which I''d be quite happy to watch for a lengthy stretch of time.</td>', 'Funny, I find this pastel image more peaceful than eerie.  The mountains and the clouds fade nicely into the larger scene, which I''d be quite happy to watch for a lengthy stretch of time.', '2014-04-02 00:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7197319, 1106945, 173844, '<td valign="top">A nice combination of the expansiveness of forest and the closeness of the clouds, an  impending storm, perhaps.  As the title says, "contrast."  I like the immediacy of the moment.</td>', 'A nice combination of the expansiveness of forest and the closeness of the clouds, an  impending storm, perhaps.  As the title says, "contrast."  I like the immediacy of the moment.', '2014-04-02 00:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
